        "sid": "NUM 9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "9",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehowa wakambila Mose mu tshihela tshia Sinai mu ngondo wa kumudilu wa tshidimu tshibidi tshiakaluhukabo mu buloba bua Ejipitu ne, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bena Isalele nebadie bintu bia kuhita kua Yehowa mu tshikondo tshinakasungula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu dituku dia dikumi ne anai dia ngondo eu ku dilolo, nebadie mu tshikondo tshiaku, bobo nebenze bu mudi mei onso ne mikenji yonso bia kuhita kua Yehowa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose wakambila Bena Isalele bua bobo bavuluke kuhita kua Yehowa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakavuluka kuhita kua Yehowa mu ngondo wa kumudilu mu dituku dia dikumi ne anai ku dilolo, mu tshihela tshia Sinai, bu muakadi mei onso akambila Yehowa Mose, Bena Isalele bakenza nunku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balume bakuabo bakadiku bakadi banyanguke kudi mubidi wa mundi mufue, kabakamanya mua kuvuluka kuhita kua Yehowa dituku adi, bakatua ku mpala kua Mose ne Alona dituku adi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "balume aba bakamuambila ne, Tudi banyanguke bua mubidi wa mundi mufue, bualu kai didi bikandibua bua tuetu katuena mua kufila mulambu wa Yehowa mu tshikondo tshiau munkatshi mua Bena Isalele? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose wakabambila ne, Imanai, nganji kunvua dî kudi Yehowa bua bualu buenu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.9.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehowa wakambila Mose ne, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wambile Bena Isalele ne, Bikala mundi wa munkatshi muenu anyi wa munkatshi mua tunkanunuma dienu munyanguke ku dilenga dia mundi mufue, anyi bikaleye muye ku luendu kule yeye neavuluke kuhita kua Yehowa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu ngondo muibidi mu dituku dia dikumi ne anai ku dilolo nebakuvuluke, nebadie mampa adi kâyi ne luevene ne matshitshi adi ne bululu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kabashiyi tshintu to ne ku dinda, kabatshibudi nansha mufuba umue, nebenze bu mudi mikenji yonso ya kuhita kua Yehowa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi mundi udi kayi munyanguke, ne udi kayi muye ku luendu, udi uhidia kuvuluka kuhita kua Yehowa, nebumushe muntu au munkatshi muabo; bualu bua yeye kakafila mulambu wa Yehowa mu tshikondo tshiau, muntu au neadituadile bubi buandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bikala muenyi munkatshi muenu udi musue kuvuluka kuhita kua Yehowa, yeye nênze bu mudi mikenji ya kuhita kua Yehowa, nenuikale ne mukenji umue kudi muenyi ne kudi muntu mulela munkatshi muenu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.9.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu dituku diakashimikabo nsubu wa tshitendelelu, ntenta wa dimanyisha dia Yehowa, ditutu diakabuikila nsubu wa tshitendelelu, ku dilolo tô ne ku dinda diakakenka bu kahia ha mutu ha nsubu wa tshitendelelu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ditutu diakabuikila nsubu matuku onso, diakakenka bu kahia butuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.9.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakumuka difutu ku mutu kua Ntenta, hashishe Bena Isalele bakaya ku luendu, mu muaba wakimana ditutu, Bena Isalele bakalongolola tshitudilu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.9.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 9:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku dî dia Yehowa Bena Isalele bakaya ku luendu, ne ku dî dia Yehowa bakalongolola tshitudilu, hakatshidi ditutu dimana ku mutu kua nsubu, bobo bakashala mu tshitudilu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.9.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.9.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 9:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakimana ditutu ku mutu kua nsubu matuku a bungi, nunku Bena Isalele bakatumikila dî dia Yehowa, kabakaya ku luendu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.9.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 9:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bikondo bikuabo ditutu diakimana ku mutu kua nsubu matuku makese, hashishe bakashala mu tshitudilu bu muakadi dî dia Yehowa, ne bakaya ku luendu bu muakadi dî dia Yehowa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.9.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.9.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 9:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bikondo bikuabo ditutu bakimana dilolo tô ne ku dinda, ne hakumuka ditutu ne dinda, bakaya ku luendu, hakumuka ditutu nansha mu munya nansha mu butuku, bakaya ku luendu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.9.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 9:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakimana ditutu nansha matuku abidi nansha ngondo nansha tshidimu, Bena Isalele bakashala mu tshitudilu, kabakaya ku luendu, hakumukadi, bakaya ku luendu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.9.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.9.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 9:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bu muakadi dî dia Yehowa bakashala mu tshituha ne bu muakadi dî ba Yehowa bakaya ku luendu, bakatumikila dî dia Yehowa, bu muakambila Yehowa Mose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.9.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.9.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
